<h1 data-copy-en="Ghost" data-copy-zh="Ghost">Ghost</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Ghost, follow her conversations and main-story requirements, and plan training and personal visits." data-copy-zh="找到 Ghost，核对谈心与主线前置，安排训练和个人拜访。">Find Ghost, follow her conversations and main-story requirements, and plan training and personal visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Other_Character_and_Army_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Animated_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Special_Openings_and_Extensions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Time_and_Archery_Focus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="After_the_Orders"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Contingency"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Off_the_Grid"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Confession"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="What_We_Fight_For"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starting_and_Building_Trust"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Ghost — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ghost.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ghost — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ghost.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ghost — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Ghost is a Resistance contact with a long personal route, five heart-to-hearts, two optional dates, skill lessons and private visits. Her later personal scenes also need main-story progress, so affection alone will not open every conversation.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_Story_Locations"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p><strong>Resistance Hideout, Future Fringe Zone: every day, 13:00–22:59.</strong> Start Talk, gifts, H2Hs, dates and Private Time from her portrait here. Later automatic scenes also use the Waste Processing Zone and the stronghold’s Operations Center; follow the route table rather than waiting for her usual portrait there.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Family_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Nude_Routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Visit_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Return to the listed location after completing each prerequisite. The ruins visit is a separate branch that must eventually be completed; the first three H2Hs are available by stage without requiring the earlier H2Hs.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Where and what is needed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Tactical Assessment</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Hideout, 13:00–22:59; Known (25), Story 15 complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Signal</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Hideout, 18:00–22:59; Friend (100), Tactical Assessment complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ghost Discovers Ancient Ruins</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Waste Processing Zone, 09:00–17:59; Friend (100). Independent of The Signal</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Breaking Protocol</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Hideout, 20:00–22:59; Crush (400), The Signal complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Cost of Command</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Operations Center, 20:00–03:59; Story 77 complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What the Signal Carries</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Hideout, 17:00–18:59; Story 78, The Cost of Command, The Signal and Ancient Ruins complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Man at the Wall</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Operations Center, 20:00–03:59; What the Signal Carries complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Line That Holds</th><td data-label="Where and what is needed">Operations Center, 03:00–04:59; The Man at the Wall complete</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">H2H</th><th scope="col">Requirements and cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">What We Fight For</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Acquaintance (50); 13:00–22:59; 45 min, 15 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Confession</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Friend (100); 18:00–22:59; 60 min, 20 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off the Grid</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Crush (400); 13:00–17:59; 90 min, 30 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Contingency</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Crush (400), Breaking Protocol, The Cost of Command and Off the Grid; 20:00–22:59; 75 min, 20 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">After the Orders</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Romantic (800), The Line That Holds and No Contingency; 17:00–18:59; 60 min, 15 Energy</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Requirements, cost and limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">15 min; +1 base affection; four/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Known; 10 min, one Wine; +7 base affection; twice/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Focus Over Emotion</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Known, Communication 85; 30 min; once: Technology +1 and 13 direct affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leadership</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Friend, Charm 22; 180 min, $400, 50 Energy; learn Leadership once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Neon Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Friend; 17:00–20:59; 120 min, $80, 30 Energy; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Glass Reef Date</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Crush; 17:00–19:59; 120 min, $120, 25 Energy; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Romantic; 120 min, 70 Energy; no separate money or Wine cost</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hot Springs</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">1,200 affection; 60 min, 40 Energy; +80 base affection; once/day; supporter access shown by the lock</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The two dates are independent of the automatic route. Hot Springs begins at the Hideout; it does not require a separate trip to the medieval spa. During Private Time, choose <strong>“Teach me about focused targeting”</strong> if you lack Archery Focus, then finish the lesson. This teaches the skill with no further lesson fee or stat gate. Other visit choices can use Rogue 35, Technology 35/45, Seduction, Silver Tongue, Intelligence 50, Charm 40, Stamina 45/55 or player Erotic Experience 1,500. Those open alternatives; none is required for the ordinary visit.</p><p>Private Time rewards come from its choices; the menu’s 25-point estimate is not an additional payment. The current visit can be repeated after it ends, despite the menu listing one/day. Affection, player Erotic Experience and Ghost’s NPC intimacy experience are separate rewards. Her favorite stats are Ability, Technology and Rogue; Archery Focus also improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>For the optional family route, unlock and enable pregnancy content, finish Akira’s Pregnancy Protocol, reach 2,000 Ghost affection and 500 Ghost NPC intimacy experience, and complete The Line That Holds plus After the Orders. In Private Time, choose the invitation to try for a child and finish the consent conversation. She must not already be pregnant, recovering or have a child from this route. Follow the Pregnancy guide for milestone timing and check-ins. While she is showing or recovering, ordinary H2Hs, dates, Leadership and private visits pause; Talk, Wine and Focus Over Emotion remain available. The separate pregnancy intimacy option is offered during the early/final stages, 19:00–22:59, for 30 minutes and 20 Energy, once/day.</p><p>With Christmas activities enabled, Known and the required supporter access, the Hideout’s <strong>Cheer Up the Resistance</strong> action takes 30 minutes, 13:00–22:59. It completes once and gives 10 direct affection plus one Christmas Token. Kupie also has a separate Love Training entry for Ghost. Shared Resistance scenes involving Jinx, Riki, Terra, Cressida and Neena follow those characters’ routes; after Story 85, the optional Syndicate alliance thread offers further shared scenes.</p><p>Time windows below are <strong>start times</strong>; 22:59 is the last minute of a window ending at 23:00. Base affection is adjusted by the relationship bonuses; direct affection is added as listed.</p><h3>Resistance Clout gifts</h3><p>Ghost is a default army member. Reach 150 Resistance Clout. From Ghost’s portrait at Underground Resistance Hideout during their available hours, choose “A Standard to Follow”. Complete this one-time scene to receive Commander's Standard. It takes no in-game time and checks Clout without spending it.</p><p>The reward enters Army Equipment; equip it on the intended hero in Barracks. Effects and alternatives: <a href="game-systems-td-army.html">TD Army</a>.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Missing portrait: arrive before 23:00; the Hideout’s usual Ghost hours end then. Later Operations scenes have their own hours.</li><li>The late route needs both story progress and the independent Ancient Ruins scene. More gifts do not replace either.</li><li>No Contingency also needs Off the Grid. After the Orders also needs No Contingency, not just The Line That Holds.</li><li>Do not substitute player Erotic Experience for the 500 Ghost intimacy requirement. A showing pregnancy can temporarily hide otherwise unlocked activities.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection stages and reward bonuses</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story — main-story progress</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy — consent, readiness and stages</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie Love Training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas activities</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Syndicate — shared missions</a></li><li><a href="character-akira.html">Akira — family-route prerequisite</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Activity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Other_Character_and_Army_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Animated_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Special_Openings_and_Extensions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Time_and_Archery_Focus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-After_the_Orders"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Contingency"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Off_the_Grid"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Confession"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-What_We_Fight_For"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_and_Building_Trust"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Ghost 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ghost.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ghost 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ghost.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ghost 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Ghost是反抗军的重要联系人。她的个人路线包含五次谈心、两场可选约会、技能学习和私人相处。后半段还需要推进主线，只有好感足够并不能开启所有对话。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_Story_Locations"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p><strong>未来时代边缘区的反抗军藏身处，每天13:00–22:59。</strong>交谈、送礼、谈心、约会和私人时间，都从这里的Ghost头像开始。后续自动事件还会发生在废料处理区和要塞的作战中心；按下表前往相应地点即可，不必在那里等她平日的头像。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Family_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Nude_Routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Visit_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>完成前置后，再次进入表中地点触发事件。遗迹事件是单独的支线，后期仍必须补完。前三次谈心各看自己的好感阶段，不要求先做完前一次谈心。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点与条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">战术评估</th><td data-label="地点与条件">藏身处13:00–22:59；已知（25），完成主线15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">信号</th><td data-label="地点与条件">藏身处18:00–22:59；朋友（100），完成“战术评估”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ghost发现远古遗迹</th><td data-label="地点与条件">废料处理区09:00–17:59；朋友（100）。不要求先完成“信号”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">打破规程</th><td data-label="地点与条件">藏身处20:00–22:59；迷恋（400），完成“信号”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">指挥的代价</th><td data-label="地点与条件">作战中心20:00–次日03:59；完成主线77</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">信号承载之物</th><td data-label="地点与条件">藏身处17:00–18:59；完成主线78、“指挥的代价”、“信号”和“Ghost发现远古遗迹”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">城墙边的男人</th><td data-label="地点与条件">作战中心20:00–次日03:59；完成“信号承载之物”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">守住防线</th><td data-label="地点与条件">作战中心03:00–04:59；完成“城墙边的男人”</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">条件与消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">我们为何而战</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">相识（50）；13:00–22:59；45分钟、15精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">告白</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">朋友（100）；18:00–22:59；60分钟、20精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">远离网络</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">迷恋（400）；13:00–17:59；90分钟、30精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有后备方案</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">迷恋（400）；完成“打破规程”、“指挥的代价”和“远离网络”；20:00–22:59；75分钟、20精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">命令之后</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">浪漫感（800）；完成“守住防线”和“没有后备方案”；17:00–18:59；60分钟、15精力</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件、消耗与次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">15分钟；基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">已知；10分钟、1份葡萄酒；基础好感+7；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">专注胜过情绪</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">已知、沟通85；30分钟；仅一次：科技+1、直接好感+13</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">领导力</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">朋友、魅力22；180分钟、$400、50精力；学习一次领导力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">霓虹集市约会</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">朋友；17:00–20:59；120分钟、$80、30精力；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玻璃礁约会</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">迷恋；17:00–19:59；120分钟、$120、25精力；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人时间</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">浪漫感；120分钟、70精力；不另收金钱或葡萄酒</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">温泉</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">好感1200；60分钟、40精力；基础好感+80；每天1次；需要满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td></tr></tbody></table><p>两场约会都独立于自动事件路线。“温泉”从藏身处开始，不需要另跑中世纪水疗馆。私人时间开场时，若尚未学会弓术专注，选择<strong>“教我精准瞄准的诀窍”</strong>并完成课程即可；没有额外学费或属性门槛。其他相处选项可能需要盗贼35、科技35／45、诱惑、巧舌如簧、智力50、魅力40、耐力45／55或玩家情趣经验1500。这些条件用于开启不同选择，并非普通相处的必需条件。</p><p>私人时间的好感来自对话选择，菜单所列的25点不会额外再加一次。目前结束后仍可再次开始，虽然菜单标示每天一次。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和Ghost的NPC亲密经验是不同数值。她偏好的属性为能力、科技和盗贼，学会弓术专注也能提高关系加成。</p><p>可选的生育路线需要解锁并开启生育内容、完成Akira的“妊娠规程”、Ghost好感2000及NPC亲密经验500，并完成“守住防线”和“命令之后”。在私人时间中选择<strong>“问 Ghost 是否愿意和你一起尝试要个孩子。”</strong>，完成双方同意的对话。她不能已怀孕、处于产后恢复期，或已有这条路线的孩子。后续阶段时间与探望方式见生育指南。显怀及产后恢复期间，普通谈心、约会、领导力学习和私人相处会暂停；交谈、送葡萄酒和“专注胜过情绪”仍可进行。怀孕前期／末期另有专属亲密选项，19:00–22:59开始，消耗30分钟、20精力，每天一次。</p><p>开启圣诞活动、达到已知并满足支持者内容权限后，可在藏身处选择<strong>“鼓舞抵抗组织”</strong>，13:00–22:59开始，消耗30分钟；仅一次，获得10直接好感及1枚圣诞代币。「Kupie 的爱之训练」中也有Ghost的独立进度。与Jinx、Riki、Terra、Cressida和Neena相关的反抗军共同事件，按对应角色路线推进；完成主线85后，辛迪加的可选联盟支线还会提供共同事件。</p><p>下表时间均指<strong>开始行动的时间</strong>；例如，结束于23:00的时段，最晚可在22:59开始。基础好感会受关系加成影响；直接好感按所列数值增加。</p><h3>反抗军声望赠礼</h3><p>Ghost是默认军队成员。反抗军声望达到150，在Ghost可用的时段，从反抗军藏身处的头像选择「值得追随的旗帜」。完成这段一次性事件，可取得「指挥官战旗」。行动不耗游戏内时间，只检查声望，不会扣除声望。</p><p>奖励进入军队装备，之后还要在兵营为目标英雄装备。效果与选择详见<a href="game-systems-td-army.html">塔防军队与训练</a>。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>看不到头像：请在23:00前到达藏身处；作战中心的后期事件使用各自时段。</li><li>后半段同时检查主线进度和独立的远古遗迹事件，多送礼不能代替这两项。</li><li>“没有后备方案”还要求“远离网络”；“命令之后”还要求“没有后备方案”，只完成“守住防线”仍不够。</li><li>生育条件中的500是Ghost的NPC亲密经验，不能用玩家情趣经验代替。显怀也可能暂时隐藏已解锁的普通行动。</li></ul></section>
